{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Car Parking Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Step into the driver\u2019s seat and test your precision! Real Car Parking Simulator focuses on what matters the most!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f Big opened city with many places to park in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 Different models of cars to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 Challenging parking spots where you have to avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae You can look at the car from many points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Become the master of parking and complete all of the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about racing \u2013 it\u2019s about precision. Show that you\u2019ve got the focus, patience, and skill to become a true parking master!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066650/5eab774e427a807db16acbf081603ddbb8c7a508.jpg"},{"name":"Expensive Car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066650/a9a8d7115ccbe0dc7542f568b7f46bf329af6b43.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066650?t=1766220010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/9e04e40c75719b6a66ba63a893ce9b9b31c45430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766220010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d7015abb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766220010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d701